  "details": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Organized, hosted, and sponsored by TheGathering.gg",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "TheGathering.gg is back with our first Timeless $1K! That's $1,000 cash in this FREE event!",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The Format is MTGA Timeless Best of Three. Rounds will be Swiss with a top cut, based on Attendance.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "We'll be hosting a $1K tournament regularly for at least the next 6 months, with a focus on Timeless and other underserved MTG Formats",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "This funding is provided in partnership with Nouns, a different kind of currency committed to the support of esports, cardgames, artistic endeavors, and other general unsupported spaces for doing cool things. You can check them out at ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "https://nouns.world/",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://nouns.world/"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": ".",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Rules",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Swiss rounds will be based on attendance. If more 16-31 players participate, the final two rounds will be a cut to top 4. If more than 32 players participate, there will be a cut to top 8 instead. The round structure will be locked in based on the attendance at the signup deadline.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The Format is MTG Arena Timeless, best of 3 matches using the MTG Arena in-game timer.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Players will use the Direct Challenge system of MTGArena to pair with each opponent. To challenge a player using this system:",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Get their MTG Arena Screen name from the MTG Melee round pairings",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Click the crossed swords in the top right corner of the MTG Arena Client",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use the Arrows to select: (Limited Tournament Match)(Deck Type:60 Card)(Format:Best of Three)(Coin Flip)(Timers On)",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "All players are required to submit a Timeless legal decklist 1 Hour before the event start time. If there is no decklist or communication from a player by the start time, that player will be dropped from the tournament.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Unintentional draws aren't allowed for this event, but intentional draws are possible with the agreement of both players. All normal MTG rules must be followed whenever possible, and there's a 0 tolerance policy for bribes, coercion, and paid agreements.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Decklists will be open, and any player can safely stream their match over discord for a chance to appear on the official broadcasts. We politely request that undefeated to stream in Discord. Do note all Top 8 Matches will be required to be streamed.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "All players must be in The Gathering Discord for communication purposes",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "In the event a player isn't in a match with their opponent within 5 minutes of the start time of each round, a match can't be completed, or a player disconnects, contact a Gathering staff member to assist. In the event of a disconnect mid-match, potential penalties include a game or match loss.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Please contact any of TheGathering.gg staff members over discord with any questions or concerns.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Schedule",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Registration closes 30 minutes before the event",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Each round will begin as soon as possible as each round finishes",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Prizes",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The organizer has agreed to pay out prizes in 60 days or less.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "1st Place: $300",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "2nd Place: $150",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "3rd-4th: $100",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "5th-8th: $75",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "$50 Held for Door Prizes or 9th place cutoff. Additional Door Prizes to be determined later and added based on attendance.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Contact",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Please contact a team member or TheGathering.gg staff member directly with any questions, comments, or concerns.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Everything is easier on ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "Discord",
            "type": "text",
